WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.301
Earlier this month,

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.403
a drone flying into the Kremlin

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:04.571
and what appeared to be

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:06.840
a major security breach for Russia.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:07.741
Theories

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.242
on what exactly happened

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:10.143
spanned from it

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.112
being a splinter group inside

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.113
Russia to the video

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.081
being a total fabrication.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:15.982
But now UN

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.217
sources tell CNN

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.585
intelligence agencies

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:19.853
in the United States

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.121
may have some evidence

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.124
that Ukraine may be behind the attack.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.358
The US has,

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.059
of course, stood

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.327
staunchly behind Ukraine

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.462
since Russia's invasion last year.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.430
So tonight we asked,

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.366
could US support for Ukraine be affected?

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.236
I want to go to Natasha Bertrand

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:38.371
with the latest from Washington.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:38.872
They use

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:39.672
the wording

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.708
may be responsible, right,

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.710
that Ukraine may be responsible

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.778
for this attack.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.012
What is the intelligence

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.415
telling us right now?

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:49.049
Yeah, Eleanor,

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.483
so this is a low confidence

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.518
assessment by the US

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:52.485
intelligence community,

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.653
which really means that they don't

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:55.622
have enough information to say

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:57.624
really definitively one way or another

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.325
who actually carried out this attack.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.293
But based on things

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.861
like who would be motivated

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.963
to do this, intercepted communications

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:05.165
among Ukrainians

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.733
pointing the finger at each other

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.101
and importantly signals

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.302
intelligence and intercepted

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.970
communications from Russian officials

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.138
that don't seem to indicate

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.506
any kind of state

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.842
sponsored false flag attack or planning

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.077
when it came to this drone attack.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.178
All points

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:18.945
to US

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.580
officials to the conclusion

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.049
that perhaps this was a Ukrainian group.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.184
But again, no definitive

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:24.984
proof of that yet.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.252
And importantly, U.S.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.487
officials don't believe that

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.288
this was actually

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:29.389
an assassination attempt,

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.691
as Russian officials have alleged.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:32.559
They believe

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:33.359
that this was

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.227
likely carried out

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:35.528
by a Ukrainian group

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.630
without any kind of direction.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.998
From the central government there

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:41.401
in Kiev from President Vladimir Zelensky.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.268
But look, another thing

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.703
contributing to this U.S.

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:44.370
assessment is that it

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.872
wouldn't be the first time

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.140
that the US has seen kind of

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.274
Ukrainian groups

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:48.942
carry out

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:51.111
operations like this on Russian soil.

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.112
Right. The U.S.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.213
intelligence community

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:55.315
pointed the finger at Ukrainians

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.351
for the car bombing in Moscow last year.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:00.019
Other kinds of operations on U.S.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:00.253
soil.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.988
Leaked Pentagon documents

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.523
have suggested that the Ukrainians

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.959
have actively planned to launch attacks

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.494
and operations on Russian soil.

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:08.394
So they

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.429
they don't necessarily

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.430
find this surprising.

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.031
But at the same time, you know,

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:12.999
this is not necessarily

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.200
going to impact

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.635
American support for Ukraine

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.537
because there's no sign

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:18.571
there are no signs yet

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.539
that the Ukrainians

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.941
are using any kind of US aid or U.S.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.344
provided weaponry to actually launch

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:25.678
these kinds of operations.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.046
Those two drones that we saw

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.948
hit the Kremlin earlier this month,

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.183
they were not us provided

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.017
they were small,

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.785
relatively lightweight drones

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:33.953
that embarrassingly

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:34.921
for the Kremlin, did

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.222
manage to bypass

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.091
Russia's air defense system.

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:40.326
So the US still kind of

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.427
looking into

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:43.530
who exactly carried this out.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.331
But for all intents and purposes,

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.566
they do not believe that

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.601
this was an attempt to kill

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.802
Vladimir Putin himself. Elaine.

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:52.639
Yeah, I mean, really important.

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:53.540
And you mentioned, you know,

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.709
whether this could affect the US support

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:57.510
for Ukraine

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.779
as we receive more information.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:01.648
I guess the big question will be

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:04.250
what equipment, what drone they used.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.618
Whoever used this

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:06.486
that that would be

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:09.923
an important distinction to make

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:11.257
That's exactly right.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.458
And these commercial

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:12.959
these drones

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:15.061
that we saw are pretty common.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:15.562
They're kind of

00:03:15.562 --> 00:03:16.863
it was kind of like a lightweight

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.331
commercial drone that was used.

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:19.365
And that's why U.S.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.567
officials are also considering

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:21.301
the possibility

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:23.770
that pro-Ukrainian Russians,

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.138
even inside Russia,

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:26.105
could have carried this out.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:27.273
Perhaps some Russians

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:28.441
who were disillusioned

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.143
with the Kremlin and its war in Ukraine.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:32.045
So not even necessarily

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.379
the Ukrainians themselves,

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.315
but the all of these motivations

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:37.283
and the fact, again, that the Russians

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:37.750
have been trying

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.552
to figure out how this actually happened

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:41.321
rather than speaking among themselves,

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:41.955
for example,

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:42.422
about

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.791
some kind of false flag operation

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:46.059
that has led the US

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.294
to consider the

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.296
possibility that perhaps yet again,

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.999
this was a Ukrainian group

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:54.300
just essentially trying

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.635
to troll the Kremlin, blaming

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:57.604
right.

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:58.404
Potential such a trend.

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.872
Thank you very much for that.

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:01.174
Well, I want to bring in zero,

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:02.141
Micheline Shapira.

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:04.010
She's a lecturer

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:04.978
at war

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:06.045
studies department

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:08.314
at King's College in London.

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:10.016
Great to have you on, Vera.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:12.118
What are your initial thoughts on

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:13.920
this new US intelligence

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.357
about what we've seen important

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.259
The wording is that

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:21.828
it may have been the Ukrainians.

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:23.496
Mm hmm.

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.331
Yeah, I think the U.S.

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:26.065
I mean, this U.S.

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:27.734
intelligence is confirming

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:30.603
what is quite the logical conclusion

00:04:30.637 --> 00:04:32.305
from everything we know.

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:34.574
And so far, about this attack.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:37.043
And that is that it was

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:40.313
probably not done by the Russians.

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:41.080
It was probably not

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.548
the false flag operation

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:43.816
and that we could see

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:45.184
from their response.

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:46.386
So when we are watching them,

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:46.619
when we

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:48.121
watching how they respond

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.689
and when we're watching

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:51.391
how they link it, frame

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.426
the blame kind of

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:53.926
and frame

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.495
that as an assassination attempt.

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:57.463
So kind of trying to go overboard,

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:59.032
but also showing that they're

00:04:59.032 --> 00:05:01.234
quite confused at first.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:03.169
And then they decided on their line.

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:05.872
So everything that we saw on the day

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:07.140
and in the following

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.141
in the following days

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:08.508
when they were

00:05:08.508 --> 00:05:10.009
still kind of very actively

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:13.713
engaged with this with this subject,

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:15.248
because obviously the news cycle in

00:05:15.248 --> 00:05:16.949
Russia is very,

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.052
very fast moving with everything

00:05:19.052 --> 00:05:19.886
that's been going on.

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:20.987
So, yeah,

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:21.554
I mean,

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:23.122
this is a logical conclusion

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:25.992
that it is some kind of Ukraine war

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:29.362
by possibly Ukrainian group or

00:05:29.395 --> 00:05:31.531
Russian sympathizers of Ukraine

00:05:33.132 --> 00:05:33.966
Yeah, exactly.

00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:35.234
So we know

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:35.968
we've we've

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:36.903
kind of narrowed it

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:38.971
down to the possibilities here

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:39.572
as the US

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.107
is still gathering intelligence,

00:05:41.107 --> 00:05:42.375
which is important

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:43.142
as we wait for

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.078
more facts to come through.

00:05:45.078 --> 00:05:46.579
But the US, of course, has been

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:48.047
one of the big supporters

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:50.116
from a monetary perspective,

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:51.984
aid in terms of weapons

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:53.920
being supplied as well.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.288
As we just heard from Natasha

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:57.290
Bertrand, important to note

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.858
what type of drone was used,

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:00.093
whether it was supplied

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:01.527
by the United States

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:02.662
and whether that would

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:03.963
then hamper

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:05.264
support

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:07.834
of the US towards Ukraine in the future.

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:10.203
Do you think that relationship now

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:11.704
is going to come into question?

00:06:13.573 --> 00:06:14.774
I find it hard to believe

00:06:14.774 --> 00:06:17.443
that that particular attack would would

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.845
bring into question

00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:21.013
the relationship between the U.S.

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:21.547
and Ukraine,

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:24.617
which is now it's been quite long.

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:27.954
The Ukrainians have shown

00:06:27.954 --> 00:06:28.921
that they are

00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:30.656
that this relationship is very important

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:31.424
for them.

00:06:31.424 --> 00:06:34.127
I think it was if it was

00:06:34.394 --> 00:06:36.062
used by a Ukrainian group

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:37.964
or even by sympathizers,

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:39.532
I think it was important to discuss

00:06:39.532 --> 00:06:40.767
on Wednesday

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:43.336
where once images where were shown

00:06:43.603 --> 00:06:45.571
a pretty obvious disregard for that

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:47.240
very easily,

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.241
that it's quite easy

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:51.210
to buy those drones to use those drones.

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:53.513
And so that kind of move

00:06:53.513 --> 00:06:55.748
this whole question to move that aside.

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:57.450
Now, having said that,

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.420
questions about how Ukraine

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.288
and what kind of actions

00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:03.956
Ukraine take in Russia,

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:05.224
I'm not speaking

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:06.793
specifically about this attack

00:07:06.793 --> 00:07:08.428
with the drones that we see.

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:10.997
That is a lingering question that is a

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.165
lingering issue,

00:07:13.699 --> 00:07:15.568
primarily because of

00:07:15.568 --> 00:07:18.971
fears of escalation with Russia.

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:21.207
Yeah, that's a really good point, right?

00:07:21.207 --> 00:07:23.109
Whether the war or the fight

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:24.210
is going to move

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.645
beyond Ukraine's borders.

00:07:25.645 --> 00:07:27.280
And we saw what happened in Belgorod,

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.047
for example,

00:07:28.047 --> 00:07:30.516
obviously very different situation there.

00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:34.153
We have seen some targets within Russia

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.489
in the past before.

00:07:36.489 --> 00:07:38.658
What is your assessment

00:07:38.658 --> 00:07:40.660
about how this could possibly play out?

00:07:40.693 --> 00:07:41.727
I think one of the things

00:07:41.727 --> 00:07:42.361
that is surprising

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:44.530
people as well is just how vulnerable

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.199
Russia is and perhaps

00:07:46.199 --> 00:07:47.667
how unprepared it is

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:50.203
for possibly attacks on its own soil.

00:07:51.637 --> 00:07:51.938
Mm hmm.

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:53.506
So I think the Ukrainians

00:07:53.506 --> 00:07:55.074
who are actually thinking on that point,

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:56.843
the Ukrainians are actually proving

00:07:56.843 --> 00:07:58.644
that their line

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:00.146
is probably the correct one,

00:08:00.146 --> 00:08:01.247
which is a the pressure

00:08:01.247 --> 00:08:02.482
is quite vulnerable

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:04.383
within its own territory,

00:08:04.383 --> 00:08:06.719
that the border is quite vulnerable

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:08.387
and that the defense

00:08:08.387 --> 00:08:10.156
air defense systems are not working

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:11.491
as well as they should.

00:08:11.491 --> 00:08:12.225
So actually,

00:08:12.225 --> 00:08:13.759
they put the Ukrainians are showing

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:15.595
everyone is that it is possible.

00:08:15.595 --> 00:08:17.363
The second thing that they're showing,

00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:19.332
and that is there is a divide within

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:21.334
what will cause an escalation in Russia.

00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:22.235
And obviously,

00:08:22.235 --> 00:08:23.603
the biggest fear always

00:08:23.603 --> 00:08:25.071
is nuclear escalation.

00:08:25.071 --> 00:08:25.638
So the Russian

00:08:25.638 --> 00:08:26.606
doctrine of nuclear

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:29.175
escalation is so fuzzy.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:32.144
And they do include a risk for a nuclear

00:08:32.144 --> 00:08:36.082
a use due to conventional end threat or

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:37.350
conventional aggression

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:38.885
or threat, conventional aggression

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:40.119
against Russia.

00:08:40.119 --> 00:08:41.654
But what the Ukrainians are showing

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:42.688
actually that the Russians

00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:43.956
have very little appetite

00:08:43.956 --> 00:08:45.591
for that kind of escalation

00:08:45.591 --> 00:08:47.426
of an escalation with the West,

00:08:47.426 --> 00:08:49.262
so that they're proving to us

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:50.496
that the Russians are aware

00:08:50.496 --> 00:08:52.632
that they can't really escalate this

00:08:52.632 --> 00:08:53.833
into a war with the West.

00:08:55.835 --> 00:08:56.836
Very great to have you on.

00:08:56.836 --> 00:08:57.637
Thank you so much.

